.
.  Plot for Chi-Square table
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
pre-erase off
erase
set ipl1na chstb.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Chi-Square PDF (Two-Sided Test at Alpha = 0.05)
TITLE OFFSET 3
TITLE SIZE 5
LABEL SIZE 5
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 4
Y1LABEL Probability
X1LABEL X
.
SET X11 HARDWARE FILL OFF
REGION FILL OFF ON ON
REGION BASE 0 ALL
.
PLOT CHSPDF(X,3) FOR X = 0 0.01 15 AND
PLOT CHSPDF(X,3) FOR X = 0 0.01 0.22 AND
PLOT CHSPDF(X,3) FOR X = 9.35 0.01 15
.
font simplex
height 3
movedata 10.0 0.02
text lc()alph() = 0.025 (9.348)
movedata 0.25 0.02
text lc()alph() = 0.025 (0.216)
.
. box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv CHSTB.PS chstb.ps
.
quit
